{"reviewId": "211151392_7XVdf9B4v", "review": {"abstract": "需要注意的是，如果按照繁荣、衰退、萧条、回升四个阶段来划分康波，康波的顶指的是衰退期的结束，也就是说，繁荣和衰退是康波的上升期。而康波的谷指的是回升的结束，也就是说，萧条和回升是康波的下降期。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "可以用正弦曲线来简单理解，零轴上方是繁荣，下方是萧条，最高点是繁荣结束衰退开始。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "2025-2121", "createTime": 1739405748, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "211151392_7XVdf9B4v", "userVid": 211151392, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 211151392, "name": "lw", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEIB7WbctHf6KgViaqPJRqKAqrdnvfch8MxjPUGQ8dUFJGFyicWJXuTh8raLHSULfuVy6SXwEyPWwxjqj6juO0IXvanDxgL09UlECiauc6UQEH0Bg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "lw", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M4-0-100", "desc": "阅读书籍", "title": "阅读书籍", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 75, "likes": [{"userVid": 409930248, "name": "羽庭", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/00GYaClAoOpgYia0sPvxA8fghq6TsbY5ialnyteBTrR9fdEj3ICMHbZw/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-100", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"reviewId": "211151392_7XVdf9B4v", "content": "这个解释不对，应该是抄底的那个点开始到水平线是繁荣，水平线到定点是衰退，到了定点就等于上升结束，开始下滑了，装不下去了。", "commentId": "211151392_7XVdf9B4v_c332829565_89VV3AgVY", "userVid": 332829565, "createTime": 1781705262, "author": {"userVid": 332829565, "name": "Tian", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/hibVD1VNicibqCMJw9SA6MIKVq0uqBXbxITmnaHFyvUKXiaia7IibmIibYX8Ra1SOy4zGibicxBQCq0D9yMK6ad2ic7KtXALQSecGA4dQ8ugpXIB9EJDo/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-2-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}}, {"content": "好像不对呀，应该是波峰是衰退期结束，然后开始进入萧条，波谷是回退期结束，然后重新进入繁荣，经济快速增长", "reviewId": "211151392_7XVdf9B4v", "commentId": "211151392_7XVdf9B4v_c67958990_86lUfLaWB", "userVid": 67958990, "createTime": 1769094874, "author": {"userVid": 67958990, "name": "Z先生", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/fuhXJtiafnazymdkAmrHibdpiaysuU3obD1slHBqwPx4Uk/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "无畏浮云遮望眼，千磨万击还坚劲", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241118-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}], "dislikeCount": 0, "synckey": 1781705262}